From: FiyeroT <me@fiyero.xyz>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 21:41:21 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 43/63] route: no direct dial back to the inbound a connection
 came in on

A direct dial back to the inbound a connection came in on is refused, and the refusals are counted,
not logged one by one.

Made of these commits of the earlier series (branch archive/r25-1.14-commits):
  7e5c9c0af route: refuse a direct dial back to the inbound the connection came in on
  2da4213ea route: count the refusals of a loop to the inbound instead of logging each
  41f832ef9 patches: adapt to sing-box 1.14.4

Pdk-Feature: route-loop
Pdk-Zone: core
Pdk-Layer: 04
